name numspell
category Package
revision 61132
shortdesc Spelling cardinal and ordinal numbers
relocated 1
longdesc This package supports the spelling of cardinal and ordinal
longdesc numbers. Supported languages are English, French, German,
longdesc Hungarian, Italian, and Latin. The package requires xstring and
longdesc iflang.
